tasks.description:
Create agents/achiri/server.ts exposing:
  POST /chat — { userId, tier?, message } → { reply, turns_in_memory, model, provider, tier }
  DELETE /memory/:userId — clear memory for user → { ok: true }
  GET /stats — memory stats + uptime → { users, total_turns, uptime_s }
  GET /health — { status: 'ok', version: '115' }

Port: 3420 (ACHIRI_PORT env var override).
All routes validate required fields, return 400 on missing.
DRY_RUN mode: ACHIRI_DRY_RUN=1 skips LLM call, returns mock response.

Surgical edit: add achiri-api entry to ecosystem.config.js apps array.
script: 'npx', args: 'ts-node agents/achiri/server.ts'
env: { NODE_ENV: 'production', ACHIRI_PORT: 3420 }
